// Choice options are unquoted text: quotes inside them are shown as they are.
// Only an option that is a whole quoted string loses its quotes.

beat Start
  choice
    "Quoted start" then more
      Picked A
    Say "hello" to her
      Picked B
    Reply "fine"
      Picked C
    "Fully quoted"
      Picked D

